anvil (0.0.2~pre1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Pre-release of the 0.0.2 personalization and localization work.
  * Russian and English UI with live switching, system-locale detection,
    typed dictionaries, pluralization, and localized dates (IMP-001).
  * Anvil Dark, Anvil Light, and Anvil High Contrast themes plus automatic
    system following, with Monaco variants and WCAG AA contrast on UI text
    (IMP-002).
  * UI and editor font family, size, line height, and ligature selection
    backed by read-only fontconfig enumeration (IMP-004).
  * Settings validation for ui.theme, ui.language, ui.fontFamily, ui.fontSize,
    editor.fontFamily, editor.lineHeight, and editor.fontLigatures.
  * Version is now derived from core/include/anvil/version.hpp, guarded by
    scripts/check-version.sh.
  * This pre-release is experimental. The Codewhale connector (IMP-003) and
    ROS 2 environment resolution (IMP-005) are not included.

 -- Anvil IDE Authors <anvil@localhost>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0000

anvil (0.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial experimental release for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS.
  * Native C++ core and GTK3/WebKitGTK shell.
  * Monaco editor with clangd hover, completion, definition, references,
    signature help, formatting, and diagnostics.
  * Workspace-scoped filesystem jail with symlink-escape protection.
  * Sandboxed clangd process using bubblewrap and seccomp.
  * File watcher, tabs with crash-safe state restore, problems panel,
    command palette, quick open, settings, and security status.
  * No telemetry, no remote content, no AI provider.
  * Build, debug, terminal, Git write operations, plugins, and AI are
    scheduled for later phases and are explicitly disabled in this release.

 -- Anvil IDE Authors <anvil@localhost>  Thu, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
